# Source workbook manifest.
#
# The workbook itself is personal health data and is NOT committed (see
# .gitignore). This manifest pins exactly which file every generated report and
# import batch refers to. Verify with:
#
#   shasum -a 256 -c data/source/MANIFEST.sha256
#
# If this check fails, the workbook has changed: re-run `pnpm import:inspect`
# and `pnpm import:extract` before trusting any report in docs/reports/.

